"en": "Ascension XII"
}
description = "进阶十一的一切，再加：每局有一名精英当守卫，守卫活着首领就带着增援；打倒守卫增援就撤掉，还能拿到一件保底的传说。在进阶十一撤离一次后解锁。"
descriptions = {
"en": "Everything in Ascension XI, and each run one elite stands guard: while it lives, the boss fights with a reinforcement. Defeat the guard to strip it, and claim a guaranteed legendary. Unlocked by extracting once on Ascension XI."
}
